{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":27.1299991607666,"text":"A square courtyard with arcades on two levels, open to the sky. It is not decoration. In a building with no electricity, the courtyard is its lamp and its extractor fan. It brings light to the rooms with no street frontage and pulls a current of air through the whole building. You will find the same plan in houses, monasteries, and schools all around the Mediterranean for thousands of years before this and after it.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"square","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"courtyard","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"with","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"arcades","start":1.899999976158142,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"on","start":2.240000009536743,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"two","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"levels","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.240000009536743},{"word":"open","start":3.8399999141693115,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"to","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"the","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"sky","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"It","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.28000020980835},{"word":"is","start":5.28000020980835,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"not","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.71999979019165},{"word":"decoration","start":5.71999979019165,"end":6.21999979019165},{"word":"In","start":6.860000133514404,"end":6.980000019073486},{"word":"a","start":6.980000019073486,"end":7.420000076293945},{"word":"building","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.420000076293945},{"word":"with","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.659999847412109},{"word":"no","start":7.659999847412109,"end":7.900000095367432},{"word":"electricity","start":7.900000095367432,"end":8.380000114440918},{"word":"the","start":8.9399995803833,"end":9.220